      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تغبّشهُ</span></b>  <i>He wronged him:</i> (O, K: [see
also 1:]) or <i>he made a false claim upon him:</i> (K,
TA:) or so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تغبّشهُ بِدَعْوَى بَاطِلَةٍ</span>: (O:) so says
As: (O, TA:) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تعبّشهُ</span> is a dial. var. thereof.
(TA.)

